---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check contract not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_stage: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert: revert Paused
    q_check_stage --> q_check_prefund: check current time in valid investment window
    q_check_prefund --> q_verify_sig: time in prefund or active period
    q_check_prefund --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature from authorized signer valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert: revert BelowMinimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> [*]: totalInvestedCapital += amount, emit Invested
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: signature must be from authorized Legion signer
        INV-002: signature prevents unauthorized participation
        INV-003: each investment requires fresh signature verification
    end note

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-004: investedCapital increases monotonically per investor during sale
        INV-005: totalInvestedCapital = sum of all individual investedCapital
    end note
